# S14z, room owner o: a new account (no online story, no online character, no card: the room starts at zero). It sits at
# the title until the guest has played its lobby, then the campaign bot starts a new game: the title gives it the room
# story, which is still empty (revision 0), and its game entering the lobby starts the story.
log at the title
idle until epoch>=@150
campaign until stage=stagml11
talk until control,frames>=60
log owner in the lobby
idle until frames>=900
log owner done
